    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Flashfire is a XY expansion released on 7 May 2014. It has 110 cards: 106 in the main set and 3 secret rares and 1 alternate versions. There are also 92 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 106 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (198 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 202 cards, adding the 3 secret rares and 1 alternate versions).",
